rent panels uh by other platforms  things like immunology markers or  inflammation markers  they all exist already in this  collection of 20 000 genes  so again you don't have to sacrifice  what you're looking at  when you can look at 20 000 different uh  gene expression events using this  particular platform  of course we keep other content on here  as well we have  housekeeping genes gender length genes  which are useful for doing quality  control of samples  and in this human go screen play we  actually have also  included some human viral content now  that content is often used to actually  set up and develop a screening  application within  a compound pharma screening that would  be done  by by the pharmaceutical companies it's  conceivable that you could  measure a viral content  with this uh say if you're screening  human samples  however that's not the intent of this  content this content was actually there  to monitor the the viral load used in  the screen itself  now much like human we've also developed  a version of this array  on rat and for that we have the clarium  ghost green rat  and here we have 21 597 rat genes and  again  much like the human version or human  counterpart of this we focused on the  well-annotated genes  for rats now one interesting  interesting thing about rat is that most  of the companies out there  are using uh two one of two different  versions  of the the rat uh species here  um we've done here empirical probe  selection  with samples using the hanwistar  rat as well as the sprague dolly  assembled genome  and this was important because if you go  to your databases  and map essentially probes and develop  gene models  that is currently all being done with  the spread dolly and  what was important for us to do is to  make sure that any snips  or genetic variation in the hand with  star would be accounted for in this  particular design  and so we're very careful to do that  basically if you're doing any kind of  uh wrap models a